  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sami Jakiyoddin Sayyad vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 8 August, 2024 2024:Bhc-Aug:17359 948-ba-1302-20 (1) In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad Bail Application No. 1302 Of 2024 Sami Jakiyoddin Sayyad Versus The State Of Maharashtra And Another ... Advocate for Applicant : Mr. Birajdar Yogesh G. App for Respondent/State : Mr. S.P. Sonpawale ... Coram : S.G. Mehare, J. Dated : August 08, 2024 Per Court:- 1. Whether Section 328 applies to the said case is a question.",
    "facts": "2. The applicant seeks bail in Crime No.274 of 2024 registered with Gandhi Chowk Police Station, District Latur for the offence punishable under Sections 328, 188, 272, 273 of the Indian Penal Code and Section 59 of Food Safety and Standards Act. The applicant was apprehended with Gutka. The muddemal has been recovered. 4. The learned APP submits that he is a habitual offender.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
